<title>THAILAND: Thai Military Bank sees slower 96 lending.</title>
<headline>Thai Military Bank sees slower 96 lending.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Military Bank Plc said on Thursday its lending growth for 1996 will not meet its previous target as a slowdown in Thailand's economy has dampened the demand for loans.</p>
<p>&quot;We earlier expected our lendings to grow 21 percent this year. But the real growth will be lower to about 18-19 percent,&quot; Thai Military Bank president Thanong Bidaya told a news conference.</p>
<p>&quot;The slow economy had reduced the demand for loans.&quot;</p>
</text>
